; Run with HSP3Dish on Emscripten.
; Expected output: before, outer-before, inner, outer-after, after.
mes "before"
on 1 gosub *wrong, *outer
mes "after"
on -1 gosub *wrong
on 2 gosub *wrong, *wrong
end
*outer
mes "outer-before"
on 0 gosub *inner
mes "outer-after"
return
*inner
mes "inner"
wait 1
return
*wrong
mes "wrong"
return
